import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 199 | Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Final Comparison: Energy-Level / Civilization / Sustainability Three Dimensions","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 199 | Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Final Comparison: Energy-Level / Civilization / Sustainability Three Dimensions","no":199,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Predatory Faction","Symbiotic Faction","Final Comparison","Three Dimensions"],"related":["197-Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory","198-Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Ascension Trajectory","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0199_模块1-掠夺派vs共生派全境总对比-能级文明可持续性三维.md","filePath":"en/0199_模块1-掠夺派vs共生派全境总对比-能级文明可持续性三维.md"}'),a={name:"en/0199_模块1-掠夺派vs共生派全境总对比-能级文明可持续性三维.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,h){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-199-predatory-vs-symbiotic-faction-realm-wide-final-comparison-energy-level-civilization-sustainability-three-dimensions" tabindex="-1">Entry 199 | Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Final Comparison: Energy-Level / Civilization / Sustainability Three Dimensions <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-199-predatory-vs-symbiotic-faction-realm-wide-final-comparison-energy-level-civilization-sustainability-three-dimensions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 199 | Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Final Comparison: Energy-Level / Civilization / Sustainability Three Dimensions&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 197, 198, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-putting-two-trajectories-on-one-general-ledger" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Putting two trajectories on one general ledger <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-putting-two-trajectories-on-one-general-ledger" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Putting two trajectories on one general ledger&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entry 197 drew the Predatory Faction&#39;s corruption curve; Entry 198 drew the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s ascension curve. This entry puts the two curves on one general ledger, doing a realm-wide final comparison from three dimensions: <strong>energy-level efficiency, civilization output, and sustainability.</strong> This table is not for moral preaching, but to answer one most practical question — in the long run, which road&#39;s general ledger is more cost-effective.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are this general table&#39;s verdict framework: the anti-predation axiom deems the predatory route noncompliant from birth; the republican axiom of Myriad Races deems the predatory route blocks the majority&#39;s road; the collective ascension axiom deems the predatory route&#39;s civilization output negative; the causal self-discipline axiom deems the predatory route&#39;s karmic debt must eventually be settled; the law-first axiom deems the predatory route&#39;s combat power inflation inevitably retcons. The three-dimensional comparison only quantifies these five verdicts; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-three-dimension-final-comparison-table" tabindex="-1">I. Three-Dimension Final Comparison Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-dimension-final-comparison-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three-Dimension Final Comparison Table&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Predatory Faction</th><th>Symbiotic Faction</th><th>General Ledger</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Short-term energy level</td><td>Fast start, surge</td><td>Steady start, slightly slow</td><td>Predatory wins first half</td></tr><tr><td>Long-term energy level</td><td>Impure origin, 90% capped</td><td>Pure and sustainable, above Origin</td><td>Symbiotic crushes second half</td></tr><tr><td>Refining / confrontation / degradation loss</td><td>70% energy spent on internal friction and security</td><td>Approaches zero</td><td>Symbiotic net efficiency one order of magnitude higher</td></tr><tr><td>Cultivable population</td><td>One strong one in exchange for a batch of victims</td><td>Batch cultivation, Myriad Races walking together</td><td>Symbiotic covers 99%</td></tr><tr><td>Civilization output</td><td>Dictatorship, closed, historical regression</td><td>Republican, open, continuous ascension</td><td>Symbiotic positive</td></tr><tr><td>Karmic accounts</td><td>Heavier as it rises, eventually backfired</td><td>Clean no accounts, lighter as it rises</td><td>Symbiotic no settlement risk</td></tr><tr><td>Sustainability</td><td>Consuming stock, cosmic entropy increase</td><td>Developing increment, cosmic entropy decrease</td><td>Symbiotic infinitely sustainable</td></tr><tr><td>Ending</td><td>Isolated collapse or court sanction</td><td>Connecting to whole network, leading to Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse</td><td>Symbiotic complete victory</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-dimension-one-energy-level-efficiency" tabindex="-1">II. Dimension One: Energy-Level Efficiency <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-dimension-one-energy-level-efficiency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Dimension One: Energy-Level Efficiency&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Short-term look at the Predatory Faction, long-term look at the Symbiotic Faction. The Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;fast&quot; is borrowing money from the future: energy brought by devouring in the first half is repaid doubly in the second half via refining, confrontation, and degradation, ultimately 90%+ capped around Dao–Dao Integration. The Symbiotic Faction seems slow, but actually every step&#39;s energy is clean, usable, accumulable, and compoundable; late-stage net efficiency overtakes. This fully agrees with Document 04&#39;s &quot;efficiency ceiling&quot; argument.</p><h2 id="iii-dimension-two-civilization-output" tabindex="-1">III. Dimension Two: Civilization Output <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-dimension-two-civilization-output" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Dimension Two: Civilization Output&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction&#39;s strong one reaching the top produces a dictator and a conquered ruin; the Symbiotic Faction&#39;s strong one reaching the top produces Myriad Races republicanism, the Alaya Network, and three hundred open systems. Plug in &quot;civilization weight&quot; — individual combat power = destructive power × civilizational consensus degree: Predatory Faction&#39;s destructive power is high but consensus degree is negative, civilization weight extremely low; Symbiotic Faction&#39;s destructive power is ethically constrained but consensus degree extremely high, civilization weight rises exponentially with realm.</p><h2 id="iv-dimension-three-sustainability" tabindex="-1">IV. Dimension Three: Sustainability <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-dimension-three-sustainability" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Dimension Three: Sustainability&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This is the most fundamental dimension. The Predatory Faction consumes the cosmos&#39;s stock; each strong one born costs the destruction of other lives and planes; the cosmos&#39;s overall entropy increase accelerates, doomed to depletion. The Symbiotic Faction develops the cosmos&#39;s increment; Myriad Races&#39; ordered symbiosis reverses entropy increase, and the cosmos as a whole sustainably ascends. The former is finite hunting-ground logic; the latter is evolvable-cosmos logic. <strong>On the dimension of sustainability, the Predatory Faction cannot win in principle.</strong></p><h2 id="v-responses-to-common-counterarguments" tabindex="-1">V. Responses to Common Counterarguments <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-responses-to-common-counterarguments" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Responses to Common Counterarguments&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>&quot;Didn&#39;t the Predatory Faction also produce strong ones in history?&quot;</strong> — Yes, but all short-lived, all capped, civilizations regressed behind them. Individual cases do not overturn the general ledger.</li><li><strong>&quot;Symbiosis is too slow, what if we can&#39;t wait?&quot;</strong> — The Multiplication Fruit&#39;s hundredfold deduction and Origin Acceleration Domain have pulled symbiosis speed to an acceptable range, fast without collapse.</li><li><strong>&quot;Can the two factions compromise?&quot;</strong> — Anti-predation is not egalitarianism, but the &quot;rob while repairing&quot; compromise also cannot pass the purity test at Origin Realm; there is no middle road.</li></ul><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the three-dimensional general ledger quantitatively proves the Predatory Faction is net waste and the Symbiotic Faction is net gain</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the final comparison upgrades anti-predation from moral proposition to a hard conclusion of efficiency and sustainability</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style predatory route comprehensively loses on three dimensions; its &quot;strong ones&quot; are just mid-way snapshots who have not reached the cap line</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the symbiotic route&#39;s three-dimensional advantage only holds when Myriad Races walk together, mutually表里 with covering 99%</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the symbiotic route&#39;s methods are all public; the predatory route&#39;s &quot;secret&quot; is essentially shady residual traces and dirty accounts</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-network-data-support-for-the-three-dimensional-comparison" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Network Data Support for the Three-Dimensional Comparison <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-network-data-support-for-the-three-dimensional-comparison" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Network Data Support for the Three-Dimensional Comparison&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction and Symbiotic Faction&#39;s final comparison across energy level, civilization, and sustainability dimensions draws all its data from the Alaya Network&#39;s long-term monitoring records. Heng Yuan Zhou does not make empty moral judgments, but speaks with quantitative data: the Predatory Faction&#39;s energy-level utilization rate, civilization survival time, and ecological recovery cycle each have network archives. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization does not win in comparison by propaganda, but by the law-first axiom&#39;s institutional design naturally winning. The universal equal infinite law is the three-dimensional comparison&#39;s ultimate judge — predatory systems inevitably produce outsiders, while symbiotic systems expand the circle to the maximum; sustainability is determined from this.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction and Symbiotic Faction&#39;s realm-wide comparison is not a good-and-evil dispute, but a settlement statement of two long-term investments. Short-term, local, looking at one person alone, the Predatory Faction may win a few rounds; realm-wide, long-term, looking at the cosmic general ledger, the Symbiotic Faction wins completely. This is the entire reason Heng Yuan Zhou chose symbiosis.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./197-掠夺派全境堕落轨迹.html">197-Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory</a> · <a href="./198-共生派全境升维轨迹.html">198-Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Ascension Trajectory</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',23)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
